{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《璀璨之城》劇情愈來愈激！昨晚張智霖飾演的孝賢徹底成魔，目露凶光將高海寧推落床兼威脅，恐怖演技嚇到網民話「真實 …</p><p></p>\n<p>《璀璨之城》劇情愈來愈激！昨晚張智霖飾演的孝賢徹底成魔，目露凶光將高海寧推落床兼威脅，恐怖演技嚇到網民話「真實得不像演出來」。不過，絕密花絮卻揭露他鏡頭後完全是另一個人，一個驚人舉動更令全場爆笑，究竟發生咩事？\n</p>\n<h2>張智霖成魔目露凶光 高海寧嚇到額頭爆青筋</h2>\n<p>在昨晚的劇情中，得勢後的孝賢（張智霖飾）將君臨舫送給Alice（高海寧飾），並冷冷地表示信奉「Sharing is caring」，暗示將有更多「厚禮」。這份美意背後卻暗藏殺機，他質問Alice：「我係咪你最信得過（嘅人）？定你覺得我畀個陷阱你踩？」當Alice企圖推卻時，孝賢即怒喝：「你嫁入嚟就係為咗呢啲嘢架啦，同我簽咗佢！」之後更失控將Alice一把推落床，目露凶光地掐住她的頸威脅：「我同你講，我娶你返嚟就係用你，我鍾意點用就點用，就算擺到明我挖個窿，你都要同我跳落去，清楚未？」張智霖的壓逼感演技真實度極高，嚇得高海寧眼球亂轉、額頭青筋盡現，畫面張力十足。\n</p>\n<h2>花絮揭驚人反差 張智霖「蠄蟝彈」上床勁紳士</h2>\n<p>雖然戲內是恐怖魔王，但鏡頭後的張智霖卻是另一副模樣。根據TVB發放的絕密花絮片段，排練這場張力爆燈的戲時，張智霖不但毫無兇惡之氣，反而散發著可愛感，頻頻令高海寧笑場。在排練撲上床一幕時，為了盡量避免身體接觸，張智霖竟展現驚人腹肌，以一招「蠄蟝彈」的姿勢跳上床，動作滑稽又體貼，引得現場所有工作人員捧腹大笑，亦充分展現了他真實一面的紳士風度，與劇中成魔的孝賢形成強烈對比。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版激讚：真實到不像演出來！</h2>\n<p>孝賢的黑化演出在網上引起洗版式討論，網民對張智霖的恐怖演技大感佩服，認為他演活了變態角色。「難怪張智霖說，在片場時，女演員們都有點懼怕他。」「想不到他演變態會這麼像，毫無違和感。」「真實到不像演出來。」而孝賢昨晚一句冷冰冰的「Sharing is Caring」，更獲網民洗版式讚好，封為年度金句！「睇花絮先知原來佢為咗唔掂到高Ling用腹肌跳上床，戲內係魔鬼，戲外係紳士，太圈粉了！」\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_7779561146ae42ea583091.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_7779561146ae42ea583091.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_21402993006ae42ea89d43a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_21402993006ae42ea89d43a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_19139341916ae42eaec4dee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_19139341916ae42eaec4dee.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_12597407506ae42eb6b0dd2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_12597407506ae42eb6b0dd2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_17491555696ae42ebc99aa4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_17491555696ae42ebc99aa4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_5085901766ae42ec6e1eab.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_5085901766ae42ec6e1eab.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_15410108836ae42ec8f37b9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_15410108836ae42ec8f37b9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17a_12558466786ae42ecbb0388.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17a_12558466786ae42ecbb0388.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_14667123966ae42ece39e32.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_14667123966ae42ece39e32.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_397303976ae42ed0cc8f3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_397303976ae42ed0cc8f3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_328477576ae42ed2f038d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_328477576ae42ed2f038d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b5%e6%99%ba%e9%9c%96/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張智霖</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%92%80%e7%92%a8%e4%b9%8b%e5%9f%8e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">璀璨之城</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%ab%98%e6%b5%b7%e5%af%a7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">高海寧</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3532924\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 30 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:04:01.528990+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1336,"images":11,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:06:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:59:37.461027+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:59:37.461027+00:00","content_hash":"eb33aeebaea0dcc52fbfbe5232d2b1305caf01cb6de690957c923b11fc09557c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}